---
const arrow = "M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6";
---
<section class="workshop-hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="workshop-title" data-workshop-hero>
  <div class="workshop-room" role="img" aria-label="A studio portrait of Miguel’s impedance matcher: machined aluminum, brass shafts, air capacitor plates and a blue controller enclosure.">
    <picture class="workshop-scene workshop-scene--still" aria-hidden="true">
      <source media="(max-width: 760px)" srcset="/assets/workshop/hardware-portrait-mobile.webp" />
      <img src="/assets/workshop/hardware-portrait.webp" width="1920" height="1440" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="sync" />
    </picture>
  </div>
  <div class="workshop-hero-copy">
    <h1 id="workshop-title">Hardware <span>&amp; firmware.</span></h1>
    <div class="workshop-hero-intro">
      <p>I'm Miguel, an electrical &amp; computer engineer at Carnegie Mellon.</p>
      <div class="workshop-hero-actions">
        <a class="workshop-link" href="#project-matcher">Explore my work <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={arrow} /></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="workshop-hero-foot">
    <p>Available for full-time roles after May 2027.</p>
  </div>
</section>
